{"unit_id":"zerodegress__dsh-authless#card-zh","repo":"zerodegress/dsh-authless","commit":"21340ddbe45a228b6739cdf121025f452d0a9e1a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-authless 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的插件，可让本地 Web UI 在通过宿主地址校验后无需启动令牌或浏览器 cookie 即可打开。它作为 host 插件接入 connection 服务，替换 browserAuth owner，并去掉 URL 中的 token 参数。主要功能包括提供无令牌的首页授权、允许 API 请求通过该 owner、保留 /connect 的 interactions 参数校验，以及在卸载时恢复原 owner。适合需要直接打开本地 DSH Web 界面的使用场景；需使用兼容的 DSH connection 服务版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:57-70","src/index.js:79-106","src/index.js:114-136","cordis.patch.yml:12-14"]}
{"unit_id":"zerodegress__dsh-authless#card-en","repo":"zerodegress/dsh-authless","commit":"21340ddbe45a228b6739cdf121025f452d0a9e1a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-authless opens the local DSH Web UI without a launch token or cookie after the host address check passes. It replaces the connection browserAuth owner, removes token parameters from URLs, validates /connect interactions, and restores the previous owner on unload.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:57-70","src/index.js:79-106","src/index.js:114-136","cordis.patch.yml:12-14"]}
