{"unit_id":"zerodegress__dsh-authless#feature-1","repo":"zerodegress/dsh-authless","commit":"21340ddbe45a228b6739cdf121025f452d0a9e1a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-authless 的功能「无令牌首页授权」：替换 connection 服务的 browserAuth owner，让首页授权直接返回通过。插件在 DSH 注入 connection 后自动生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:67-70","src/index.js:114-126"]}
{"unit_id":"zerodegress__dsh-authless#feature-2","repo":"zerodegress/dsh-authless","commit":"21340ddbe45a228b6739cdf121025f452d0a9e1a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-authless 的功能「清理启动地址」：从宿主提供的地址移除 token 查询参数和 URL fragment，并保留其余路径与参数。宿主调用 authenticatedUrl 时自动执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:28-43","src/index.js:104-106"]}
{"unit_id":"zerodegress__dsh-authless#feature-3","repo":"zerodegress/dsh-authless","commit":"21340ddbe45a228b6739cdf121025f452d0a9e1a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-authless 的功能「连接交换」：处理 /connect 的 interactions 声明，只接受一次 none 或 answer；有效请求创建 operator peer 并返回重定向。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:79-101"]}
{"unit_id":"zerodegress__dsh-authless#feature-4","repo":"zerodegress/dsh-authless","commit":"21340ddbe45a228b6739cdf121025f452d0a9e1a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-authless 的功能「卸载恢复」：owner 替换成功后注册清理回调；插件卸载时若当前仍是自身 owner，就恢复原来的宿主 owner。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:125-135"]}
{"unit_id":"zerodegress__dsh-authless#caveat-1","repo":"zerodegress/dsh-authless","commit":"21340ddbe45a228b6739cdf121025f452d0a9e1a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-authless 使用前须知：目标 connection 服务需提供 browserAuth 字段；字段缺失时会告警并保留宿主原 owner，启动令牌闸门也保持原状。（见 src/index.js:117-123）","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:117-123"]}
